{% comment %}
  VAULTGUARDS - Collection Section (works for BOTH your TAG and PSA
  collections automatically - no separate file needed per brand)

  This theme only exposes JSON templates for collections (no plain Liquid
  template file to paste into), so this ships as a SECTION instead. Sections
  are added on top of the existing JSON template through the theme editor.

  INSTALL:
  1. Admin > Online Store > Themes > Edit code.
  2. In the left sidebar, find "Sections" > click the plus icon next to it >
     name the new file "vg-collection" (it will be saved as
     sections/vg-collection.liquid) > select all the placeholder text >
     delete > paste this whole file in > Save.
  3. Go to Online Store > Themes > Customize.
  4. At the very top of the Customize screen there is a page picker
     dropdown. Switch it to "Collections" > then choose "Default collection
     template" (this applies to every collection at once, including both
     your TAG and PSA collections) or a single real collection if you only
     want to change one.
  5. In the left panel you will see the sections already on this template.
     Scroll to the bottom of that list and click "Add section" > find
     "Vaultguards Collection" in the list > click it to add it.
  6. Drag "Vaultguards Collection" up so it is the first (or only) section.
  7. Click the existing default sections (for example "Collection banner",
     "Product grid") one at a time > click the eye icon next to each to hide
     it, or the trash icon to remove it, so only Vaultguards Collection is
     visible on the page.
  8. Click Save in the top right.
  9. Open a real collection page on your storefront to confirm it shows this
     design instead of the default Shopify layout.
{% endcomment %}

<section class="vg-section" style="padding-top:56px;">
  <div class="vg-container">
    <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}#shop" style="color:var(--vg-navy-400); font-size:13px; text-decoration:none;">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to shop
    </a>
    <div class="vg-reveal vg-in" style="margin-top:18px; margin-bottom:40px;">
      <div class="vg-eyebrow">{{ collection.title }}</div>
      <h1 style="font-size:38px; margin-top:14px;">All {{ collection.title }} colorways.</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--vg-navy-400); margin-top:10px; font-size:15px;">
        {{ collection.products_count }} colorways
        {% assign in_stock_count = 0 %}
        {% for product in collection.products %}{% if product.available %}{% assign in_stock_count = in_stock_count | plus: 1 %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
        &middot;
        {% if in_stock_count > 0 %}{{ in_stock_count }} in stock{% else %}currently sold out &mdash; preview any of them live in The Vault{% endif %}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="vg-grid-4">
      {% for product in collection.products %}
        <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="vg-card vg-product-card vg-reveal" data-delay="{{ forloop.index0 | modulo: 4 }}">
          <div class="vg-product-card-img">
            <img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 700 }}" alt="{{ product.title }}" loading="lazy" width="700" height="875">
          </div>
          <div class="vg-product-card-body">
            <div style="font-weight:600; font-size:15px; margin-bottom:6px;">{{ product.title }}</div>
            <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;">
              <span style="color:var(--vg-navy-600);">{{ product.price | money }}</span>
              <span class="{% if product.available %}vg-pill vg-pill-in{% else %}vg-pill vg-pill-out{% endif %}">
                {% if product.available %}In stock{% else %}Out of stock{% endif %}
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:48px;">
      <a href="{{ pages['the-vault'].url | default: '/pages/the-vault' }}" class="vg-btn vg-btn-gold" data-vg-haptic="tap"><i class="fa-solid fa-vault"></i> Preview Your Slab in The Vault</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Vaultguards Collection",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
